WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:27.140
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:27.410 --> 01:34.890
[The Great Long March]

3
01:35.320 --> 01:37.660
[Episode 54]

4
01:39.000 --> 01:40.930
The situation in northern Shaanxi

5
01:41.400 --> 01:42.860
is different from Ruijin.

6
01:43.200 --> 01:45.400
If we stick to the Ruijin approach again

7
01:45.479 --> 01:47.479
and seek development through consolidation,

8
01:47.479 --> 01:48.840
the final result

9
01:49.229 --> 01:52.039
may well be that even consolidation becomes difficult,

10
01:52.039 --> 01:53.509
let alone development.

11
01:53.840 --> 01:55.840
That's why I adapted to local conditions

12
01:55.840 --> 01:57.570
and changed the prescription:

13
01:57.680 --> 02:00.280
seeking consolidation through development.

14
02:00.510 --> 02:02.070
Launching the Eastern Expedition

15
02:02.070 --> 02:04.800
is a plan I've been thinking about for a long time.

16
02:06.200 --> 02:07.150
Don't worry.

17
02:07.560 --> 02:09.169
At the meeting tomorrow,

18
02:09.990 --> 02:12.710
I'll fully express my views.

19
02:15.170 --> 02:17.930
I found that after the Gouba Conference,

20
02:18.120 --> 02:19.840
you have grown further.

21
02:19.940 --> 02:23.000
You stopped arguing with them from the very beginning.

22
02:25.140 --> 02:26.050
Enlai.

23
02:29.030 --> 02:31.560
We have gone through the 25,000-li Long March

24
02:31.710 --> 02:34.310
and faced so many difficulties and obstacles.

25
02:34.840 --> 02:36.079
How many times

26
02:36.310 --> 02:39.310
have we stood at the crossroads of important choices?

27
02:39.700 --> 02:41.460
One wrong step,

28
02:41.680 --> 02:43.430
and we would be doomed.

29
02:44.430 --> 02:45.520
But in the end,

30
02:46.150 --> 02:48.430
we still chose the right direction

31
02:49.030 --> 02:50.690
and came to northern Shaanxi.

32
02:51.680 --> 02:52.520
Tell me.

33
02:52.590 --> 02:53.840
What else

34
02:54.630 --> 02:56.630
could be better than such an experience

35
02:56.630 --> 02:58.800
to temper a person's spiritual will

36
02:58.820 --> 03:00.620
and psychological resilience?

37
03:01.840 --> 03:04.310
What else could make a person grow more

38
03:05.080 --> 03:07.360
than such a process?

39
03:07.800 --> 03:10.530
I think after experiencing the Long March,

40
03:11.120 --> 03:14.430
it's not just one person or a group of people

41
03:14.750 --> 03:16.030
who have grown,

42
03:16.400 --> 03:18.430
but our entire Party.

43
03:19.120 --> 03:20.190
Yes.

44
03:20.740 --> 03:22.180
What we experienced

45
03:22.579 --> 03:25.020
is not only growth in reality,

46
03:25.310 --> 03:26.440
but at the same time,

47
03:27.040 --> 03:29.760
we also experienced spiritual growth.

48
03:33.280 --> 03:34.120
By the way,

49
03:35.079 --> 03:36.560
one more thing.

50
03:37.430 --> 03:40.440
Zhidan's wife made a special trip to deliver this

51
03:40.870 --> 03:43.590
and asked me to hand it to you personally.

52
03:43.960 --> 03:45.000
What is this?

53
03:45.170 --> 03:46.290
Open it and see.

54
03:58.800 --> 03:59.430
Cotton shoes.

55
03:59.430 --> 03:59.940
Yes.

56
04:00.280 --> 04:00.800
For me?

57
04:00.820 --> 04:01.470
Yes.

58
04:01.630 --> 04:03.470
She didn't know your shoe size,

59
04:03.490 --> 04:04.710
so she made them by rough estimate.

60
04:04.710 --> 04:05.640
Rough estimate?

61
04:06.350 --> 04:07.310
Try them on.

62
04:08.950 --> 04:09.470
Okay.

63
04:35.630 --> 04:36.360
How are they?

64
04:36.430 --> 04:37.310
Do they fit?

65
04:37.510 --> 04:38.390
Yes, they do.

66
04:39.000 --> 04:40.260
The size is just right.

67
04:40.409 --> 04:41.050
Great.

68
04:41.200 --> 04:42.630
Sister-in-law Liu was afraid they wouldn't fit.

69
04:42.630 --> 04:44.540
Now she should be happy.

70
04:44.960 --> 04:46.740
How did Sister-in-law Liu make the rough estimate?

71
04:46.740 --> 04:49.270
Comrade Zhidan must have described it to her.

72
04:51.540 --> 04:53.270
Zhidan described it to her?

73
04:54.120 --> 04:55.090
When did Comrade Zhidan

74
04:55.090 --> 04:56.680
observe me?

75
04:59.610 --> 05:01.050
Comrade Zhidan

76
05:01.260 --> 05:04.060
is really a down-to-earth and attentive comrade.

77
05:04.930 --> 05:06.590
When I see Sister-in-law Liu,

78
05:06.610 --> 05:08.070
I will thank her in person.

79
05:14.130 --> 05:15.080
Just right.

80
05:24.680 --> 05:27.410
Zhang Guotao replied to Comrade Zhang Hao.

81
05:27.960 --> 05:29.430
The telegram was forwarded

82
05:29.430 --> 05:32.290
by Lin, Nie, Peng, and Li.

83
05:32.920 --> 05:34.409
He still refers to himself as "the CPC Central Committee."

84
05:34.409 --> 05:36.340
The content is unbearable to read.

85
05:36.680 --> 05:39.540
He not only continues to deny the Zunyi Conference,

86
05:39.790 --> 05:41.250
but also calls our northward march to resist Japan

87
05:41.250 --> 05:42.760
"flightism."

88
05:43.360 --> 05:44.330
Yet his southward march

89
05:44.330 --> 05:46.850
has become a heroic and fearless attack.

90
05:46.940 --> 05:48.330
Calling black white.

91
05:48.920 --> 05:49.890
Comrade Zhang Hao,

92
05:49.890 --> 05:51.770
he is complaining about us to you.

93
05:52.880 --> 05:54.080
What about you three?

94
05:54.090 --> 05:56.630
[Lin Yuying (Zhang Hao), Member of the CPC delegation to the Comintern]

95
05:54.159 --> 05:55.430
I want to know your attitude

96
05:55.430 --> 05:57.159
towards this matter.

97
06:00.360 --> 06:03.720
Establishing the Anti-Japanese National United Front

98
06:03.830 --> 06:06.360
is about to become the general strategic line

99
06:06.480 --> 06:08.560
of our Party and our army.

100
06:08.720 --> 06:10.000
Under this premise,

101
06:10.040 --> 06:11.700
we must unite even with the Northeastern Army

102
06:11.700 --> 06:13.000
and the Northwestern Army,

103
06:13.000 --> 06:14.750
let alone our own comrades.

104
06:15.950 --> 06:17.480
The Red Army marching south

105
06:17.510 --> 06:19.160
is a great force.

106
06:19.420 --> 06:21.470
We cannot deny all comrades

107
06:21.690 --> 06:23.690
because of Zhang Guotao's mistake.

108
06:23.710 --> 06:24.630
I believe

109
06:25.360 --> 06:26.880
that the comrades of the 4th Front Army,

110
06:26.880 --> 06:28.340
after learning the truth,

111
06:28.490 --> 06:30.350
also won't support Zhang Guotao.

112
06:31.360 --> 06:33.000
Enlai said

113
06:33.130 --> 06:35.450
our Long March is a march of spirit.

114
06:35.680 --> 06:36.630
I believe

115
06:36.920 --> 06:38.140
the comrades of the 4th Front Army

116
06:38.140 --> 06:40.370
will also experience a long march of spirit

117
06:40.370 --> 06:41.570
and true growth.

118
06:43.159 --> 06:43.990
At present,

119
06:44.430 --> 06:46.760
for the unity of the Party and the Red Army,

120
06:46.830 --> 06:48.480
and for uniting to resist Japan,

121
06:48.480 --> 06:50.830
we still need to show our utmost sincerity

122
06:50.870 --> 06:52.430
to win Zhang Guotao over.

123
06:52.830 --> 06:54.870
Hope he can realize his errors

124
06:54.890 --> 06:57.159
and return to the correct path.

125
06:57.520 --> 06:59.430
Zhang Guotao mentioned in his telegram

126
06:59.430 --> 07:02.100
the Comintern and the 7th National Congress of the Party.

127
07:02.100 --> 07:03.290
I'm thinking

128
07:03.950 --> 07:05.640
that the disputes about the past

129
07:05.640 --> 07:07.600
can wait until the Communist International

130
07:07.600 --> 07:09.430
or the 7th National Congress of the Party

131
07:09.430 --> 07:11.670
convenes and be resolved then.

132
07:11.870 --> 07:12.930
The most urgent task

133
07:12.930 --> 07:15.580
is still to prioritize the overall situation of resisting Japan.

134
07:15.580 --> 07:16.380
Although we temporarily cannot

135
07:16.380 --> 07:18.070
get in touch with the Comintern,

136
07:18.070 --> 07:19.360
I am willing to act

137
07:19.600 --> 07:20.950
as a member of the CPC delegation to the Comintern

138
07:20.950 --> 07:22.360
to actively communicate

139
07:22.400 --> 07:24.320
with Zhang Guotao.

140
07:24.500 --> 07:26.830
I will try to make him change his attitude,

141
07:26.980 --> 07:29.310
abandon his stance against the Central Committee,

142
07:29.310 --> 07:30.820
and take concrete action to fully implement

143
07:30.820 --> 07:32.340
the spirit of the 7th World Congress of the Comintern

144
07:32.340 --> 07:34.280
and the Party's August 1 Declaration.

145
07:34.280 --> 07:35.080
That's great,

146
07:35.190 --> 07:36.270
Comrade Zhang Hao.

147
07:36.870 --> 07:39.600
Zhang Guotao doesn't dare to offend the Communist International.

148
07:39.600 --> 07:42.040
One word from you is worth ten from us.

149
07:42.240 --> 07:44.140
It couldn't be better for you to step forward.

150
07:44.140 --> 07:46.670
Alright, I'll draft the telegram right away.

151
07:46.820 --> 07:48.830
I will first convey the spirit of the 7th World Congress of the Comintern

152
07:48.830 --> 07:50.090
and the general strategic line

153
07:50.090 --> 07:51.600
of the Anti-Japanese National United Front

154
07:51.600 --> 07:54.130
established by the Central Committee to him.

155
07:54.170 --> 07:57.630
Then regarding his relationship with the Central Committee…

156
08:00.160 --> 08:01.120
I think

157
08:01.560 --> 08:03.230
we can make some concessions.

158
08:03.870 --> 08:05.260
If he remains unconvinced by the Central Committee,

159
08:05.260 --> 08:07.510
he can be temporarily managed by the Communist International.

160
08:07.510 --> 08:09.750
Let's resolve the main contradiction first.

161
08:09.750 --> 08:12.280
Alright, I'll draft the telegram right away.

162
08:12.480 --> 08:14.800
During the Wayaobu Conference,

163
08:14.800 --> 08:16.360
while the Central Committee was struggling

164
08:16.360 --> 08:18.360
against Zhang Guotao's splittism,

165
08:18.590 --> 08:21.390
the 2nd and the 6th Red Army Corps,

166
08:21.410 --> 08:23.000
which had embarked on their journey on November 19,

167
08:23.000 --> 08:24.190
successively broke through

168
08:23.850 --> 08:26.340
[He Long, Corps Commander of the 2nd Red Army Corps]

169
08:24.210 --> 08:26.180
the blockade of the KMT troops,

170
08:26.240 --> 08:28.080
arrived in the central Hunan region,

171
08:28.080 --> 08:29.070
mobilized the masses,

172
08:29.070 --> 08:31.200
and established a revolutionary base area.

173
08:31.200 --> 08:33.409
Chiang Kai-shek immediately adjusted his deployment,

174
08:33.179 --> 08:35.140
[Ren Bishi, Member of the Politburo of the CPC Central Committee; Political Commissar of the 2nd Red Army Corps]

175
08:33.429 --> 08:35.480
mobilizing the Central Army's core forces

176
08:35.480 --> 08:36.710
to form a new encirclement

177
08:36.710 --> 08:38.970
around the 2nd and the 6th Red Army Corps.

178
08:39.159 --> 08:40.840
Faced with a massive enemy force,

179
08:40.840 --> 08:42.970
He Long, Ren Bishi, and others decided

180
08:42.980 --> 08:45.360
to use the tactic of feinting east and striking west.

181
08:45.360 --> 08:47.750
They first feigned a move toward southeastern Hunan.

182
08:47.750 --> 08:48.910
After shaking off the enemy,

183
08:48.910 --> 08:49.860
they turned west

184
08:49.880 --> 08:52.790
to head to eastern Guizhou as originally planned.

185
08:53.280 --> 08:56.040
On December 22, 1935,

186
08:56.310 --> 08:57.320
the main force of the Corps

187
08:57.320 --> 08:59.840
was attacked in the Wawutang area of Suining County, Hunan,

188
08:57.570 --> 09:00.040
[Huangjin Village; Laoyatian]

189
09:00.190 --> 09:01.550
by the 62nd Division

190
09:00.650 --> 09:06.940
[Jinwutang; Wawutang]

191
09:01.580 --> 09:03.620
of the KMT troops.

192
09:03.920 --> 09:05.660
Tasked with the blocking and covering mission,

193
09:05.660 --> 09:07.400
the 5th Division of the 2nd Red Army Corps

194
09:07.400 --> 09:09.690
fought a desperate battle with the enemy.

195
09:08.870 --> 09:11.170
[Suining County, Hunan]

196
09:10.270 --> 09:11.290
During the battle,

197
09:11.290 --> 09:14.890
He Bingyan, Commander of the 5th Division, was severely wounded.

198
09:14.890 --> 09:16.090
Director He!

199
09:16.390 --> 09:17.550
Director He!

200
09:17.570 --> 09:18.290
What happened?

201
09:18.290 --> 09:19.020
Director He!

202
09:19.120 --> 09:20.340
Please save our Division Commander!

203
09:20.340 --> 09:21.550
Save our Division Commander!

204
09:21.550 --> 09:22.240
He Bingyan.

205
09:22.260 --> 09:24.620
Director He, I have to trouble you again.

206
09:24.520 --> 09:26.190
[He Biao, Director of the Health Department of the 2nd Red Army Corps]

207
09:24.910 --> 09:27.170
Where else are you hurt besides your arm?

208
09:27.670 --> 09:30.150
Why did you rush to the front again?

209
09:32.750 --> 09:34.010
Hurry, carry him away!

210
09:35.410 --> 09:36.250
He Bingyan!

211
09:36.790 --> 09:37.750
Don't sleep!

212
09:38.150 --> 09:39.720
Talk to me. Talk!

213
09:39.630 --> 09:42.480
[He Bingyan, Commander of the 5th Division of the 2nd Red Army Corps]

214
09:39.740 --> 09:41.450
The tough fear the reckless,

215
09:41.750 --> 09:43.670
and the reckless fear the relentless.

216
09:43.670 --> 09:44.600
What is he saying?

217
09:44.600 --> 09:46.270
This is what Division Commander said during the pre-battle mobilization.

218
09:46.270 --> 09:47.630
The tough fear the reckless,

219
09:47.630 --> 09:49.000
and the reckless fear the relentless.

220
09:49.000 --> 09:50.120
Our division must

221
09:50.120 --> 09:51.360
pin the enemy down here

222
09:51.360 --> 09:52.780
to cover the main force's withdrawal.

223
09:52.780 --> 09:53.690
He's too badly wounded.

224
09:53.690 --> 09:54.790
I'm not sure I can save him.

225
09:54.790 --> 09:55.320
Xiaolin!

226
09:55.360 --> 09:55.840
Here!

227
09:55.870 --> 09:57.440
Ride my horse to catch up with our Corps Commander.

228
09:57.440 --> 09:58.810
Report the condition of Division Commander He to him.

229
09:58.810 --> 09:59.450
Yes, sir!

230
10:06.910 --> 10:07.910
Corps Commander!

231
10:10.600 --> 10:11.630
Corps Commander!

232
10:11.650 --> 10:12.550
Reporting, Corps Commander.

233
10:12.550 --> 10:13.840
Division Commander He of the 5th Division is severely wounded.

234
10:13.840 --> 10:14.870
The situation is critical.

235
10:14.870 --> 10:15.700
What?

236
10:22.870 --> 10:23.790
Bandages! Quickly!

237
10:23.790 --> 10:24.120
Yes.

238
10:24.120 --> 10:25.000
Another one.

239
10:25.430 --> 10:27.720
You have to hold on. Hold on!

240
10:27.910 --> 10:28.840
He.

241
10:29.280 --> 10:30.830
Tell me the truth.

242
10:31.240 --> 10:32.910
Can you save my arm?

243
10:32.970 --> 10:33.920
Don't talk.

244
10:33.950 --> 10:35.810
I need to stop the bleeding first.

245
10:36.130 --> 10:37.770
Don't beat around the bush.

246
10:37.860 --> 10:39.260
I'm telling you, He Biao.

247
10:39.270 --> 10:40.990
You must save this arm of mine.

248
10:41.010 --> 10:43.010
If you can't save it,

249
10:43.150 --> 10:45.080
then carry me back to the position.

250
10:50.360 --> 10:52.360
Corps Commander! Corps Commander!

251
10:52.870 --> 10:53.530
Corps Commander.

252
10:53.530 --> 10:54.530
Corps Commander.

253
10:55.150 --> 10:55.960
How is it?

254
10:56.030 --> 10:57.030
Corps Commander.

255
10:57.030 --> 10:58.720
The bleeding has stopped, but…

256
10:58.720 --> 10:59.600
Speak.

257
10:59.840 --> 11:01.000
It was hit by a bullet from the Thompson submachine gun.

258
11:01.000 --> 11:02.910
The bullet shattered all the bones in his right arm.

259
11:02.910 --> 11:04.120
This arm has to be amputated.

260
11:04.120 --> 11:05.020
Otherwise, if it gets infected,

261
11:05.020 --> 11:06.430
he will die.

262
11:08.960 --> 11:09.960
Corps Commander.

263
11:10.620 --> 11:11.620
Good boy.

264
11:11.650 --> 11:12.650
He Biao said,

265
11:12.770 --> 11:14.380
if this arm isn't amputated,

266
11:14.830 --> 11:16.870
you'll lose your life to infection.

267
11:19.950 --> 11:21.070
Okay.

268
11:22.240 --> 11:23.270
Amputate it.

269
11:23.550 --> 11:25.840
Corps Commander, don't be sad.

270
11:26.180 --> 11:27.300
Director He,

271
11:27.840 --> 11:28.960
amputate it.

272
11:30.450 --> 11:32.050
I still have my left hand.

273
11:32.200 --> 11:33.200
I can still fight!

274
11:40.470 --> 11:41.620
That's the spirit.

275
11:42.050 --> 11:44.030
You're worthy of being one of my soldiers.

276
11:44.030 --> 11:45.000
Don't worry.

277
11:45.390 --> 11:46.750
When you recover,

278
11:46.830 --> 11:49.630
you'll still be the commander of my main division.

279
11:51.840 --> 11:53.440
Thank you, Corps Commander.

280
11:54.990 --> 11:56.460
When is the surgery?

281
11:56.520 --> 11:58.350
Right now. The sooner, the better.

282
11:58.350 --> 11:59.510
With other wounds to deal with as well,

283
11:59.510 --> 12:00.610
it'll take at least two or three hours.

284
12:00.610 --> 12:02.630
What about the medicine and equipment?

285
12:02.630 --> 12:03.870
The hospital relocated in advance.

286
12:03.870 --> 12:05.740
We have neither equipment nor anesthetics.

287
12:05.740 --> 12:06.470
We have only…

288
12:11.330 --> 12:12.730
Only an iron saw.

289
12:15.290 --> 12:16.620
Are you crazy?

290
12:16.720 --> 12:17.840
Two or three hours,

291
12:17.890 --> 12:19.040
without anesthetics.

292
12:19.040 --> 12:20.790
You're going to saw a living person with a big saw.

293
12:20.790 --> 12:21.910
Can he bear it?

294
12:21.930 --> 12:23.270
If there were any other way,

295
12:23.270 --> 12:24.780
I wouldn't be so cruel.

296
12:24.800 --> 12:26.160
All we can do now is

297
12:26.510 --> 12:28.630
boil this saw a little longer.

298
12:28.810 --> 12:29.850
Director He.

299
12:30.360 --> 12:31.390
Corps Commander.

300
12:31.940 --> 12:35.190
Have someone tie me to this wooden board.

301
12:36.070 --> 12:37.990
Give me a towel to bite on.

302
12:38.480 --> 12:40.240
Just saw without hesitation.

303
12:40.670 --> 12:41.680
I can take it.

304
12:47.940 --> 12:50.350
Good boy. Bear with it.

305
12:50.630 --> 12:51.510
Don't worry.

306
12:51.640 --> 12:53.920
However long the surgery takes,

307
12:54.750 --> 12:55.880
I will stay with you.

308
12:56.200 --> 12:57.150
I won't leave.

309
12:57.630 --> 12:58.510
Someone!

310
12:58.670 --> 12:59.240
Here!

311
12:59.260 --> 13:00.210
Pass on my order.

312
13:00.360 --> 13:01.170
Tell the 5th Division

313
13:01.170 --> 13:02.880
to hold off the enemy for three hours.

314
13:02.880 --> 13:04.920
Fight to buy enough time

315
13:04.940 --> 13:06.070
for their division commander's surgery.

316
13:06.070 --> 13:06.720
Yes, sir!

317
13:07.870 --> 13:08.550
He Biao!

318
13:09.360 --> 13:10.210
Here!

319
13:10.550 --> 13:12.000
Look into my eyes!

320
13:12.550 --> 13:14.080
I only have one order.

321
13:14.280 --> 13:17.470
Save He Bingyan's life.

322
13:17.630 --> 13:18.430
Yes, sir!

323
13:19.280 --> 13:19.880
Someone!

324
13:19.910 --> 13:20.960
Get a rope! Hurry!

325
13:26.090 --> 13:28.040
Bear with it. Bear with it.

326
13:29.040 --> 13:30.370
Tie him tightly. Hurry!

327
14:41.470 --> 14:42.200
Boy.

328
14:47.200 --> 14:58.250
♪ If you want to eat chilies, don't fear the heat ♪

329
14:58.790 --> 15:09.860
♪ If you want to join the Red Army, don't fear death ♪

330
15:10.970 --> 15:17.690
♪ Even with a blade at your neck ♪

331
15:17.910 --> 15:26.150
♪ Cutting off your head leaves only a scar the size of a bowl ♪

332
15:28.150 --> 15:35.510
♪ If you want to eat chilies, don't fear the heat ♪

333
15:35.510 --> 15:44.120
♪ If you want to join the Red Army, don't fear death ♪

334
15:44.480 --> 15:51.150
♪ Even with a blade at your neck ♪

335
15:51.170 --> 15:59.160
♪ Cutting off your head leaves only a scar the size of a bowl ♪

336
16:05.760 --> 16:06.640
Gauze.

337
16:09.210 --> 16:10.290
Corps Commander.

338
16:12.280 --> 16:14.510
The surgery is done.

339
16:27.790 --> 16:29.130
You made it through.

340
16:30.270 --> 16:31.510
You made it through.

341
16:31.850 --> 16:33.130
Let me fight.

342
16:33.250 --> 16:35.310
Let me fight.

343
16:52.630 --> 16:53.750
Comrades.

344
16:55.360 --> 16:57.720
These are He Bingyan's bones.

345
16:59.270 --> 17:02.200
They are the bones of a Communist!

346
17:17.869 --> 17:18.440
Next,

347
17:18.470 --> 17:21.450
let's invite Comrade Mao Zedong to continue his speech.

348
17:21.450 --> 17:24.450
[Wayaobu, Shaanxi]

349
17:24.960 --> 17:25.619
Comrades.

350
17:27.700 --> 17:28.590
Yesterday,

351
17:29.040 --> 17:31.150
all of us

352
17:31.570 --> 17:34.130
expressed our opinions on the question

353
17:34.370 --> 17:36.500
of our next military strategic policy

354
17:36.590 --> 17:38.320
and reached a basic consensus.

355
17:38.500 --> 17:39.390
That is,

356
17:39.640 --> 17:43.270
no matter which direction we develop in,

357
17:43.510 --> 17:45.710
we should not give up Shaanxi and Gansu,

358
17:46.200 --> 17:47.510
the base area we have worked so hard

359
17:47.510 --> 17:48.780
to establish.

360
17:49.870 --> 17:51.910
Now what we are mainly discussing is

361
17:52.110 --> 17:55.040
whether to seek development through consolidation

362
17:55.830 --> 17:58.490
or to seek consolidation through development.

363
17:59.530 --> 18:00.870
Our current situation

364
18:00.900 --> 18:02.850
can be summarized in one phrase:

365
18:03.500 --> 18:06.760
beset with difficulties both internally and externally.

366
18:06.870 --> 18:07.870
Internally,

367
18:08.330 --> 18:10.820
we lack food and clothing and have no supplies.

368
18:10.820 --> 18:11.610
Externally,

369
18:11.810 --> 18:14.270
the enemy is besieging us and pressing hard.

370
18:14.550 --> 18:15.880
In such an environment,

371
18:16.100 --> 18:17.510
if we don't push forward

372
18:17.640 --> 18:19.270
and only try to hold our ground,

373
18:19.270 --> 18:20.350
the final result

374
18:20.530 --> 18:22.470
will probably be that we can neither hold our ground

375
18:22.470 --> 18:24.030
nor develop.

376
18:25.050 --> 18:27.200
The enemy will not withdraw.

377
18:27.550 --> 18:28.980
The barren land of Shaanxi and Gansu

378
18:28.980 --> 18:30.780
will not grow more grain either.

379
18:31.870 --> 18:32.700
Therefore,

380
18:33.290 --> 18:35.510
staying in the middle among the east, west, south, and north

381
18:35.510 --> 18:37.170
is probably not going to work.

382
18:37.570 --> 18:38.450
So next,

383
18:39.070 --> 18:40.250
we need to discuss

384
18:40.750 --> 18:43.580
which direction we should actually develop in.

385
18:46.160 --> 18:46.900
I think

386
18:47.610 --> 18:50.640
moving south, west, or north

387
18:50.960 --> 18:52.310
will all be difficult.

388
18:52.400 --> 18:53.240
Moving south.

389
18:54.640 --> 18:56.170
The important city of Xi'an

390
18:56.960 --> 18:58.360
is the enemy's base camp,

391
18:58.590 --> 19:00.850
where they have stationed heavy troops.

392
19:00.880 --> 19:01.920
Attacking Xi'an

393
19:02.160 --> 19:05.020
will bring the Central Army into northern Shaanxi,

394
19:05.310 --> 19:08.070
which will make the situation even more unfavorable for us.

395
19:08.070 --> 19:08.960
Also,

396
19:09.090 --> 19:10.160
if we attack Xi'an,

397
19:10.350 --> 19:12.720
it means we have to continue fighting Zhang Xueliang

398
19:12.720 --> 19:13.720
and Yang Hucheng.

399
19:14.050 --> 19:15.570
That would go against

400
19:15.600 --> 19:18.230
our general line of

401
19:18.490 --> 19:20.410
establishing the Anti-Japanese National United Front.

402
19:20.410 --> 19:22.070
Then what about moving north?

403
19:23.200 --> 19:24.610
I don't think it will work.

404
19:24.610 --> 19:27.000
Although the enemy in the north is weak,

405
19:27.310 --> 19:29.040
the north is a desert wasteland.

406
19:29.040 --> 19:31.720
It's even more barren than northern Shaanxi

407
19:32.000 --> 19:33.770
and has a small population.

408
19:34.680 --> 19:35.740
How can we develop?

409
19:35.960 --> 19:37.050
So I think

410
19:37.290 --> 19:39.690
Comrade Peng Dehuai's idea of moving north

411
19:40.070 --> 19:43.090
is mostly considered from a military perspective

412
19:43.620 --> 19:44.690
and is one-sided.

413
19:45.310 --> 19:47.860
Next, let me talk about moving west.

414
19:48.400 --> 19:50.660
We came to northern Shaanxi from the west

415
19:50.830 --> 19:52.240
on the Long March.

416
19:52.240 --> 19:53.480
The west is just like the north,

417
19:53.480 --> 19:54.810
full of deserts and Gobi.

418
19:54.810 --> 19:56.410
In the direction of Ningxia,

419
19:56.770 --> 19:59.710
it's an area inhabited by ethnic minorities, with a vast land and sparse population.

420
19:59.710 --> 20:01.360
If we move west at this time,

421
20:01.480 --> 20:02.600
materially speaking,

422
20:02.600 --> 20:03.660
we cannot develop.

423
20:04.550 --> 20:05.620
Most importantly,

424
20:05.780 --> 20:08.050
the anti-Japanese frontline is in North China.

425
20:08.050 --> 20:08.980
It's in the east.

426
20:10.200 --> 20:12.070
If we go west,

427
20:12.350 --> 20:14.070
we have no just cause.

428
20:14.350 --> 20:15.720
If we ourselves go west,

429
20:15.790 --> 20:18.310
how can we unite the Northeastern Army and the Northwestern Army

430
20:18.310 --> 20:19.770
to resist Japan together?

431
20:21.030 --> 20:22.070
Comrade Zedong,

432
20:22.310 --> 20:24.070
then please tell everyone

433
20:24.160 --> 20:26.000
the benefits of us going east.

434
20:26.160 --> 20:27.160
Alright.

435
20:29.110 --> 20:32.000
I think there are five major benefits

436
20:32.240 --> 20:33.640
to developing eastward.

437
20:33.880 --> 20:34.880
First,

438
20:35.240 --> 20:37.720
the banner of our Eastern Expedition is the clearest.

439
20:37.720 --> 20:39.400
We are going to the anti-Japanese frontline

440
20:39.400 --> 20:41.350
to play the dual roles of the proletarian revolutionary vanguard

441
20:41.350 --> 20:43.640
and the anti-Japanese vanguard of the Chinese nation,

442
20:43.640 --> 20:44.510
which will

443
20:45.080 --> 20:48.150
promote a new high tide of Anti-Japanese resistance in North China and nationwide,

444
20:48.150 --> 20:49.240
thereby facilitating

445
20:49.240 --> 20:52.700
the realization of the Anti-Japanese National United Front.

446
20:53.440 --> 20:54.240
Comrades,

447
20:54.790 --> 20:57.710
our Long March is not over.

448
20:59.000 --> 21:00.200
Wasn't our Long March

449
21:01.510 --> 21:03.830
for the purpose of going north to resist Japan?

450
21:03.830 --> 21:05.840
Our Eastern Expedition is also to go

451
21:05.960 --> 21:08.890
to the very frontline of Anti-Japanese resistance.

452
21:08.920 --> 21:10.780
That's what gives us a just cause.

453
21:12.110 --> 21:12.880
Second,

454
21:13.160 --> 21:15.220
militarily, our Eastern Expedition

455
21:16.270 --> 21:17.200
can avoid

456
21:17.400 --> 21:20.460
a confrontation with Zhang Xueliang and Yang Hucheng.

457
21:20.750 --> 21:22.880
This is conducive to winning them over

458
21:22.880 --> 21:24.740
and uniting them to resist Japan.

459
21:25.370 --> 21:26.300
Third,

460
21:29.240 --> 21:31.070
our Eastern Expedition to Shanxi

461
21:31.070 --> 21:33.510
threatens Yan Xishan's stronghold.

462
21:33.720 --> 21:35.380
He absolutely won't accept it

463
21:35.450 --> 21:39.180
and will definitely recall the Jin-Sui Army stationed to our north

464
21:39.270 --> 21:41.240
back to Shanxi.

465
21:41.440 --> 21:42.400
In this way,

466
21:42.680 --> 21:44.890
the pressure on our base area will be greatly reduced.

467
21:44.890 --> 21:46.490
We can take this opportunity

468
21:46.640 --> 21:48.890
to eliminate the remaining enemies in northern Shaanxi

469
21:48.890 --> 21:52.330
to achieve the goal of consolidating our base area.

470
21:53.790 --> 21:54.560
Fourth,

471
21:56.160 --> 21:57.440
in our Eastern Expedition,

472
21:57.440 --> 22:00.100
as long as we control the Yellow River Crossing,

473
22:00.110 --> 22:01.960
we can advance or withdraw freely.

474
22:01.960 --> 22:03.640
Strategically, that means we have the initiative

475
22:03.640 --> 22:04.680
and freedom.

476
22:05.000 --> 22:05.850
Also,

477
22:06.960 --> 22:07.960
the fifth point

478
22:08.570 --> 22:10.220
involves our Comrade Bo Gu.

479
22:12.540 --> 22:13.450
Me?

480
22:13.960 --> 22:15.310
Shanxi is densely populated

481
22:15.310 --> 22:16.570
and rich in resources.

482
22:16.640 --> 22:19.100
Yan Xishan might not be good at other things,

483
22:19.830 --> 22:22.680
but he is capable of making a fortune quietly.

484
22:23.960 --> 22:24.920
In recent years,

485
22:25.240 --> 22:27.790
he has turned Shanxi into a small independent kingdom.

486
22:27.790 --> 22:29.880
Building railways, reorganizing banks,

487
22:29.880 --> 22:32.880
and establishing the Northwest Industrial Company,

488
22:33.070 --> 22:35.470
he has amassed great bureaucratic wealth.

489
22:35.750 --> 22:37.920
Correspondingly, the common people

490
22:38.350 --> 22:41.330
are unbearably miserable and ruthlessly exploited.

491
22:41.330 --> 22:42.960
Our Eastern Expedition to Shanxi

492
22:42.960 --> 22:43.750
can both

493
22:43.750 --> 22:45.550
solve our urgent supply problem

494
22:45.640 --> 22:48.850
and expand the Red Army's manpower pool.

495
22:50.970 --> 22:51.940
That makes sense.

496
22:51.940 --> 22:54.020
As Director of the Northwest Office

497
22:54.040 --> 22:55.310
of the Chinese Soviet Government,

498
22:55.310 --> 22:56.480
you won't have to worry about

499
22:56.480 --> 22:58.610
making bricks without straw anymore.

500
23:01.070 --> 23:02.000
Comrades.

501
23:02.400 --> 23:03.750
Lenin said

502
23:03.920 --> 23:07.400
that dialectics is the study of the contradictions

503
23:07.430 --> 23:09.760
within the very essence of the object itself.

504
23:09.760 --> 23:12.200
He called this the core of dialectics.

505
23:13.160 --> 23:14.290
My understanding is

506
23:14.310 --> 23:16.700
that in the process of the development of things,

507
23:16.700 --> 23:19.510
many contradictions often exist at the same time.

508
23:19.670 --> 23:21.680
Among these coexisting contradictions,

509
23:21.680 --> 23:24.280
there is always one principal contradiction.

510
23:24.650 --> 23:27.070
The existence and development of this principal contradiction

511
23:27.070 --> 23:28.110
often affect

512
23:28.130 --> 23:31.930
the existence and development of other secondary contradictions.

513
23:32.190 --> 23:33.910
Many of our comrades believe

514
23:33.930 --> 23:36.500
that the principal contradiction

515
23:37.110 --> 23:38.710
our Red Army currently faces

516
23:40.970 --> 23:43.310
is the problem of survival in northern Shaanxi.

517
23:43.310 --> 23:44.400
In my opinion,

518
23:44.680 --> 23:46.210
above this contradiction,

519
23:46.890 --> 23:49.150
there is an even greater contradiction,

520
23:54.030 --> 23:55.490
which is resisting Japan.

521
23:55.960 --> 23:57.600
Our march to the north is to resist Japan.

522
23:57.600 --> 23:59.340
Our survival is also to resist Japan.

523
23:59.340 --> 24:00.710
At today's meeting,

524
24:00.920 --> 24:03.270
the five strategic directions that everyone talked about—

525
24:03.270 --> 24:05.400
the east, south, west, north, and middle,

526
24:05.400 --> 24:08.360
should all revolve around the principal contradiction of resisting Japan.

527
24:08.360 --> 24:09.780
If this contradiction is not resolved,

528
24:09.780 --> 24:11.720
there will be no water in the kettle.

529
24:11.720 --> 24:13.000
If there is no water in the kettle,

530
24:13.000 --> 24:15.860
no matter how small your cup is, it cannot be filled.

531
24:16.610 --> 24:17.540
On the contrary,

532
24:17.880 --> 24:20.010
what if we resolve this contradiction

533
24:20.310 --> 24:21.780
and establish a broad

534
24:22.120 --> 24:24.320
Anti-Japanese National United Front?

535
24:25.200 --> 24:26.880
Then there will be water in the kettle.

536
24:26.880 --> 24:27.720
In this way,

537
24:27.750 --> 24:29.160
everyone's cups

538
24:29.180 --> 24:30.400
can be filled with water.

539
24:30.400 --> 24:31.070
Right.

540
24:31.510 --> 24:32.210
Exactly.

541
24:32.750 --> 24:34.200
Our current situation

542
24:34.240 --> 24:36.440
is the eve of a great national change.

543
24:37.740 --> 24:40.750
This is conducive to the development of revolutionary forces.

544
24:40.750 --> 24:43.830
To fulfill our historical mission,

545
24:43.920 --> 24:46.670
our Red Army must expand rapidly.

546
24:47.510 --> 24:48.970
All of this depends on

547
24:49.890 --> 24:52.680
our seeking consolidation through development.

548
24:52.680 --> 24:53.550
Only in this way

549
24:53.720 --> 24:55.070
can we realize

550
24:55.090 --> 24:57.520
the Anti-Japanese National United Front.

551
24:57.750 --> 24:58.720
Only in this way

552
24:58.790 --> 25:01.000
can we rush more quickly

553
25:01.390 --> 25:03.600
to the battlefield against Japan.

554
25:19.440 --> 25:21.510
After full discussion at the meeting,

555
25:21.510 --> 25:24.110
Mao Zedong's proposal was finally accepted.

556
25:24.350 --> 25:26.000
With Mao Zedong's military report

557
25:26.000 --> 25:27.200
as the basic content,

558
25:27.370 --> 25:29.030
the meeting formed and passed

559
25:29.220 --> 25:33.000
the "Resolution of the Central Committee on the Question of Military Strategy."

560
25:33.000 --> 25:35.460
It determined that the next military tasks of the Red Army

561
25:35.460 --> 25:38.110
were mainly to open up the anti-Japanese route

562
25:38.140 --> 25:40.920
and to consolidate and expand the existing Soviet areas,

563
25:40.920 --> 25:43.370
with the former as the central task.

564
25:44.570 --> 25:47.130
On December 24, 1935,

565
25:47.480 --> 25:50.400
according to the military strategy

566
25:50.510 --> 25:52.200
determined at the Wayaobu Meeting,

567
25:52.200 --> 25:54.160
Mao Zedong, Chairman of the Northwest Revolutionary Military Commission,

568
25:54.160 --> 25:55.420
and Vice Chairman Zhou Enlai

569
25:55.420 --> 25:56.730
formulated and issued

570
25:57.240 --> 25:59.970
the "Plan for Forty Days of Preparatory Action."

571
26:00.590 --> 26:03.200
With the support and cooperation of the Party, government, military, and civilians,

572
26:03.200 --> 26:05.580
the 1st Front Red Army in the Shaanxi-Gansu Soviet Area

573
26:05.580 --> 26:09.380
fully transitioned into preparations for the Eastern Expedition.

574
26:09.550 --> 26:11.960
On December 27, 1935,

575
26:12.240 --> 26:13.870
at the Party's activists' meeting in Wayaobu,

576
26:13.870 --> 26:16.660
Mao Zedong delivered a report

577
26:16.830 --> 26:19.110
titled "On the Tactics of

578
26:19.110 --> 26:19.900
Opposing Japanese Imperialism."

579
26:19.900 --> 26:20.770
Comrades.

580
26:21.240 --> 26:23.110
The current political situation

581
26:23.130 --> 26:25.660
has undergone great changes.

582
26:27.070 --> 26:29.110
Based on this changed situation,

583
26:29.370 --> 26:32.700
our Party has defined its own tasks.

584
26:33.510 --> 26:36.130
What is the current situation?

585
26:36.980 --> 26:38.920
The basic characteristic of the current situation

586
26:38.700 --> 26:41.560
[Xi Zhongxun, Student of the Party School of the CPC Central Committee]

587
26:39.590 --> 26:41.250
is that Japanese imperialism

588
26:41.700 --> 26:44.710
wants to turn China into its colony.

589
26:46.050 --> 26:47.200
As you all know,

590
26:47.440 --> 26:50.240
for nearly a hundred years,

591
26:50.330 --> 26:53.200
China has been a semi-colonial country

592
26:53.350 --> 26:56.210
dominated jointly by several imperialist powers.

593
26:57.180 --> 26:59.180
Comrades, look!

594
26:59.350 --> 27:00.870
For about a year and a half,

595
27:01.350 --> 27:04.140
the three main forces of the Chinese Red Army

596
27:04.330 --> 27:06.930
have been making major positional transfers.

597
27:07.560 --> 27:08.960
During these transfers,

598
27:09.320 --> 27:10.710
our Red Army itself

599
27:10.880 --> 27:12.510
has been considerably weakened.

600
27:12.510 --> 27:14.200
So some people say

601
27:14.350 --> 27:17.030
that the Central Red Army has failed.

602
27:17.200 --> 27:18.350
Is this statement correct?

603
27:18.350 --> 27:19.640
No.

604
27:19.670 --> 27:20.810
Why is it not correct?

605
27:20.810 --> 27:22.480
Because it is not a fact.

606
27:22.200 --> 27:25.160
[Geng Biao, Chief of Staff of the 1st Red Army Division] [Yang Chengwu, Political Commissar of the 1st Red Army Division]

607
27:23.110 --> 27:24.850
When Marxists look at a problem,

608
27:24.850 --> 27:26.480
they must see not only the parts

609
27:26.480 --> 27:28.000
but also the whole.

610
27:28.270 --> 27:29.920
A frog sitting in a well

611
27:29.940 --> 27:31.670
says the sky is as big as the well.

612
27:31.670 --> 27:33.310
This is obviously incorrect.

613
27:33.310 --> 27:34.510
Everyone knows

614
27:34.550 --> 27:36.150
the sky is bigger than a well.

615
27:36.210 --> 27:37.650
Right!

616
27:37.680 --> 27:38.770
Bigger than a well.

617
27:39.610 --> 27:41.610
We have completed the Long March.

618
27:50.810 --> 27:52.810
Good! Good!

619
27:54.170 --> 27:55.220
Comrades.

620
27:55.960 --> 27:58.570
We are currently on the eve of a great change.

621
27:59.400 --> 28:00.530
The Party's task

622
28:00.870 --> 28:03.310
is to combine the activities of the Red Army

623
28:03.470 --> 28:07.430
with all the activities of workers, peasants, students,

624
28:07.450 --> 28:08.500
the petty bourgeoisie,

625
28:08.500 --> 28:10.850
and the national bourgeoisie across the country

626
28:10.850 --> 28:11.810
in order to form

627
28:11.840 --> 28:15.660
a unified national revolutionary front.

628
28:15.920 --> 28:21.830
Good! Good!

629
28:21.850 --> 28:24.380
What is the basic strategic task of the Party?

630
28:24.510 --> 28:25.510
Nothing else

631
28:25.530 --> 28:27.510
but to establish a broad

632
28:28.080 --> 28:30.280
national revolutionary united front.

633
28:30.750 --> 28:34.070
When the revolutionary situation has changed,

634
28:34.160 --> 28:35.530
the revolutionary tactics

635
28:35.530 --> 28:37.430
and the style of revolutionary leadership

636
28:37.430 --> 28:39.160
must also change accordingly.

637
28:39.220 --> 28:40.690
The task of Japanese imperialism

638
28:40.690 --> 28:42.690
and the traitors

639
28:42.770 --> 28:45.560
is to turn China into a colony,

640
28:48.150 --> 28:49.590
while our task

641
28:49.880 --> 28:54.050
is to turn China into an independent, free country

642
28:54.960 --> 28:56.680
with territorial integrity.

643
28:56.680 --> 29:04.480
Good! Good! Good!

644
29:04.890 --> 29:06.490
Let's discuss in groups.

645
29:06.550 --> 29:09.750
Good! Good! Good!

646
29:16.530 --> 29:18.790
That was a great speech. Thank you for your hard work.

647
29:18.790 --> 29:20.960
I brought you some big red jujubes

648
29:21.160 --> 29:21.900
to replenish your energy.

649
29:21.900 --> 29:22.500
They're really sweet.

650
29:22.500 --> 29:23.600
Where did you get these?

651
29:23.600 --> 29:25.130
I came here for the meeting.

652
29:25.570 --> 29:27.460
The old landlady saw that I was tired from working.

653
29:27.460 --> 29:29.030
She cared about me, so she gave them to me.

654
29:29.030 --> 29:30.930
Isn't it your duty to help the fellow villagers?

655
29:30.930 --> 29:32.140
And you took her jujubes?

656
29:32.140 --> 29:32.970
I paid for them.

657
29:32.970 --> 29:34.070
I absolutely won't violate discipline.

658
29:34.070 --> 29:34.610
Have a taste.

659
29:34.610 --> 29:35.320
Chairman Mao!

660
29:35.320 --> 29:36.250
Chairman Mao.

661
29:40.030 --> 29:40.880
Greetings, Chairman Mao.

662
29:40.880 --> 29:41.530
Greetings, Chairman Mao.

663
29:41.530 --> 29:42.050
Hello.

664
29:43.000 --> 29:44.240
You two old partners

665
29:44.300 --> 29:45.900
are working together again.

666
29:46.070 --> 29:47.640
With Chen Geng, you two,

667
29:47.750 --> 29:50.150
plus Deputy Division Commander Yang Dezhi

668
29:50.160 --> 29:51.500
and Director Tan Zheng of the Political Department,

669
29:51.500 --> 29:52.940
no wonder everyone says

670
29:53.060 --> 29:54.290
the leadership team of the First Red Division

671
29:54.290 --> 29:55.200
is the Five Tiger Generals

672
29:55.200 --> 29:56.960
that span our Red Army.

673
29:57.060 --> 29:58.100
Please rest assured, Chairman.

674
29:58.100 --> 29:58.830
Our First Red Division

675
29:58.830 --> 30:00.500
will definitely serve as the vanguard in the Eastern Expedition.

676
30:00.500 --> 30:01.100
Good.

677
30:02.140 --> 30:03.970
You must learn from each other,

678
30:04.000 --> 30:05.220
make progress together,

679
30:05.220 --> 30:06.350
and maintain unity.

680
30:07.080 --> 30:08.450
If there are difficulties,

681
30:08.450 --> 30:09.430
shoulder them together.

682
30:09.430 --> 30:10.420
If there are jujubes,

683
30:10.420 --> 30:11.520
share them together.

684
30:11.520 --> 30:13.890
Today, your Division Commander Chen Geng set an example

685
30:13.890 --> 30:14.850
by taking a few jujubes

686
30:14.850 --> 30:16.660
and having me share them with everyone.

687
30:16.660 --> 30:17.410
Thank you, Chairman.

688
30:17.410 --> 30:17.900
Take one more.

689
30:17.900 --> 30:20.360
If I had known, I would have bought a few more.

690
30:24.880 --> 30:29.540
[Renjiaba, Lushan, Sichuan]

691
30:30.160 --> 30:31.190
Currently,

692
30:31.440 --> 30:34.570
the main forces of the Sichuan Army is mainly concentrated in

693
30:34.570 --> 30:36.960
the Mingshan and Qionglai areas.

694
30:37.160 --> 30:38.810
Xue Yue's six divisions

695
30:38.270 --> 30:39.150
[Zhang Guotao, Member of the Standing Committee of the CPC Politburo]

696
30:38.950 --> 30:41.190
have also started to assemble

697
30:39.150 --> 30:40.030
[Vice Chairman of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission; General Political Commissar of the Red Army]

698
30:41.310 --> 30:44.770
towards the Ya'an and Tianquan areas from Chengdu and Xinjin.

699
30:44.990 --> 30:46.880
And Li Baobing.

700
30:47.200 --> 30:49.160
Li Baobing's 53rd Division

701
30:49.180 --> 30:52.490
has already been deployed in Luding and Kangding.

702
30:52.930 --> 30:54.650
The enemies in various places

703
30:54.810 --> 30:56.310
are building fortresses

704
30:57.280 --> 30:58.810
and advancing step by step.

705
31:02.880 --> 31:05.610
Comrade Xiangqian and Comrade Changhao believe

706
31:05.680 --> 31:07.160
that if the enemy now

707
31:07.270 --> 31:10.830
launches a massive attack on our Lushan and Tianquan areas,

708
31:10.850 --> 31:13.360
we'll fall into a disadvantageous position with strong enemies in front,

709
31:13.360 --> 31:14.760
no base area behind,

710
31:14.780 --> 31:17.060
and nowhere to advance or withdraw.

711
31:17.760 --> 31:19.390
If that time really comes,

712
31:19.440 --> 31:22.900
[Li Te, Deputy Chief of Staff of the 4th Front Red Army; Dean of Education of the Red Army University]

713
31:19.880 --> 31:20.960
I'm afraid

714
31:21.780 --> 31:24.380
we can only terminate the southward operation

715
31:25.310 --> 31:26.770
and be forced to relocate.

716
31:29.480 --> 31:31.210
General Political Commissar.

717
31:33.640 --> 31:34.860
Come, sit down first.

718
31:39.720 --> 31:41.780
I've been thinking about a question.

719
31:41.920 --> 31:43.480
Military passivity

720
31:44.240 --> 31:46.300
can be resolved through relocation.

721
31:46.570 --> 31:48.370
How should political passivity

722
31:49.230 --> 31:51.150
be resolved?

723
31:56.050 --> 31:58.780
Are you referring to Comrade Lin Yuying's reply?

724
31:58.920 --> 32:00.130
Look.

725
32:00.680 --> 32:02.270
I first knew Lin Yuying

726
32:02.330 --> 32:04.330
when he went to Wuhan

727
32:04.360 --> 32:06.160
to guide the workers' movement.

728
32:06.910 --> 32:07.920
Later,

729
32:07.940 --> 32:10.200
we both went to Moscow one after another.

730
32:10.480 --> 32:11.890
So we have some connections

731
32:11.890 --> 32:13.150
and know of each other.

732
32:14.130 --> 32:15.680
But I didn't expect

733
32:15.750 --> 32:18.410
that he would now join forces with Mao Zedong,

734
32:18.430 --> 32:20.490
who's leading the peasant movement.

735
32:20.660 --> 32:24.180
But in his reply,

736
32:24.440 --> 32:26.070
didn't he point out that we could be managed by

737
32:26.070 --> 32:27.800
the Communist International?

738
32:28.040 --> 32:29.300
Looking at it this way,

739
32:29.990 --> 32:32.150
he doesn't seem to favor either side.

740
32:33.590 --> 32:35.290
Don't you think this is more like

741
32:35.290 --> 32:37.100
the idea of Mao, Zhang, and Zhou?

742
32:37.400 --> 32:39.530
They did so under the banner of unity,

743
32:40.490 --> 32:41.600
but in reality,

744
32:42.590 --> 32:44.740
aren't they just trying to shift the blame for the split

745
32:44.740 --> 32:45.870
onto me?

746
32:46.580 --> 32:47.500
Of course.

747
32:47.920 --> 32:49.240
Their attitude

748
32:49.290 --> 32:50.770
is not important to me.

749
32:51.200 --> 32:52.520
But I value the opinion

750
32:53.380 --> 32:55.510
of the Communist International more.

751
32:57.460 --> 33:01.330
Without a proper title, words carry no weight.

752
33:09.210 --> 33:10.470
Commander-in-Chief.

753
33:11.020 --> 33:11.660
Bocheng.

754
33:11.680 --> 33:12.440
Quick. Come.

755
33:12.460 --> 33:13.390
Come sit here.

756
33:13.420 --> 33:15.140
Perfect timing.

757
33:15.180 --> 33:16.000
Bocheng is here.

758
33:16.000 --> 33:17.110
You must be freezing.

759
33:17.110 --> 33:18.350
Come, let's eat.

760
33:18.410 --> 33:19.330
What a feast!

761
33:19.930 --> 33:21.000
Not at all.

762
33:21.790 --> 33:22.580
Bocheng.

763
33:23.200 --> 33:24.800
Isn't tomorrow the New Year?

764
33:26.300 --> 33:27.840
Look at me, my brain's not working.

765
33:27.840 --> 33:29.430
Time flies so fast.

766
33:29.520 --> 33:31.470
I remember last New Year,

767
33:31.720 --> 33:33.440
we had just finished a meeting in Houchang,

768
33:33.440 --> 33:35.510
and you came in covered in snow.

769
33:35.690 --> 33:37.800
Later, we even went to the mountain top to watch the snow.

770
33:37.800 --> 33:38.800
I can't forget it.

771
33:39.250 --> 33:41.720
I still remember Chairman Mao reciting the line

772
33:41.720 --> 33:43.220
"Three chi and three from the sky" that day.

773
33:43.220 --> 33:44.070
Right.

774
33:45.130 --> 33:48.930
"Aye, mountains, piercing the blue without breaking their spikes.

775
33:49.150 --> 33:50.350
The sky may collapse.

776
33:50.640 --> 33:53.640
To prop it up, betwixt Heaven and Earth they do abide."

777
33:54.110 --> 33:54.960
Alright.

778
33:54.960 --> 33:56.370
How about we eat while we talk?

779
33:56.370 --> 33:56.930
Okay.

780
33:57.830 --> 33:59.000
Commander-in-Chief.

781
33:59.000 --> 34:00.280
Happy New Year.

782
34:00.370 --> 34:01.090
Good.

783
34:01.350 --> 34:02.510
Here's to a fresh start for us

784
34:02.510 --> 34:04.200
in the new year.

785
34:04.580 --> 34:05.650
Cheers.

786
34:10.949 --> 34:13.159
In order to have a fresh start in the new year,

787
34:13.159 --> 34:15.150
we must change our old thinking.

788
34:16.340 --> 34:18.929
Now we are completely passive militarily,

789
34:19.210 --> 34:20.560
but Zhang Guotao

790
34:21.000 --> 34:22.250
is still hesitating.

791
34:22.290 --> 34:23.360
If this continues,

792
34:23.510 --> 34:26.719
it'll be no different from sitting still waiting for death.

793
34:26.719 --> 34:28.980
It's unrealistic to expect Zhang Guotao

794
34:29.020 --> 34:30.350
to turn back on his own.

795
34:30.520 --> 34:32.500
We should take action.

796
34:33.110 --> 34:33.949
Action?

797
34:34.810 --> 34:35.920
What action?

798
34:38.530 --> 34:39.270
Bocheng.

799
34:40.530 --> 34:43.860
I'm going to serve you a big dish today.

800
34:46.130 --> 34:47.940
This is a telegram sent to Zhang Guotao

801
34:47.940 --> 34:49.139
by Comrade Lin Yuying

802
34:49.250 --> 34:51.250
of the Comintern delegation.

803
34:51.440 --> 34:52.400
Take a look.

804
34:53.510 --> 34:54.760
Where did you get this?

805
34:54.760 --> 34:56.440
Truth will come to light.

806
34:56.659 --> 34:59.530
The news has already spread in the headquarters.

807
34:59.670 --> 35:01.280
I simply went to the Confidential Communications Section

808
35:01.280 --> 35:03.230
and copied down the contents of the telegram.

809
35:03.230 --> 35:03.670
Read the contents.

810
35:03.670 --> 35:04.190
Okay.

811
35:08.840 --> 35:11.840
This telegram shows at least two points.

812
35:12.190 --> 35:12.960
First,

813
35:13.110 --> 35:16.920
the Comintern supports the Central Committee's northward march to resist Japan.

814
35:16.920 --> 35:17.760
Second,

815
35:17.800 --> 35:20.960
the Central Committee has not given up on uniting the 4th Front Army

816
35:20.960 --> 35:22.610
and has made enough concessions

817
35:22.610 --> 35:24.970
to win over Zhang Guotao.

818
35:25.230 --> 35:29.190
Now a nationwide upsurge of resistance against Japan has already emerged.

819
35:29.190 --> 35:30.510
The troops marching south

820
35:30.510 --> 35:33.240
have fallen into a passive position militarily.

821
35:33.960 --> 35:36.000
This is the critical moment to prompt Zhang Guotao

822
35:36.000 --> 35:37.920
to change his attitude.

823
35:38.400 --> 35:40.710
I think we should step forward

824
35:40.800 --> 35:42.440
and actively cooperate with the CPC Central Committee

825
35:42.440 --> 35:44.510
to build a bridge between the Central Committee

826
35:44.510 --> 35:45.770
and the 4th Front Army.

827
35:46.480 --> 35:47.190
How about this?

828
35:47.190 --> 35:48.150
After dinner,

829
35:48.360 --> 35:49.350
I will go to the Communications Bureau

830
35:49.350 --> 35:51.510
and send a telegram to the Central Committee in my own name.

831
35:51.510 --> 35:52.360
Okay.

832
35:53.230 --> 35:54.150
Put it away.

833
35:55.670 --> 35:56.480
Let's eat.

834
35:57.810 --> 35:58.480
Okay.

835
36:05.880 --> 36:07.140
Commander-in-Chief.

836
36:07.590 --> 36:09.920
I remember you are six years older than me.

837
36:10.320 --> 36:12.030
You were born in 1886.

838
36:13.230 --> 36:15.320
By traditional Chinese age reckoning,

839
36:15.320 --> 36:16.280
after today,

840
36:16.360 --> 36:17.920
you will be fifty years old.

841
36:21.800 --> 36:22.730
Confucius said,

842
36:22.760 --> 36:24.920
"At fifty I knew the Mandate of Heaven."

843
36:24.920 --> 36:26.280
But I want to say

844
36:26.840 --> 36:29.480
that the mandate of heaven is not up in heaven,

845
36:30.330 --> 36:32.060
but in the hearts of the people.

846
36:32.590 --> 36:36.650
Marching north to resist Japan is exactly what's in the people's hearts.

847
36:39.950 --> 36:40.560
Let's eat.

848
36:47.340 --> 36:51.260
[Wayaobu, Shaanxi]

849
36:48.410 --> 36:50.410
The reconnaissance unit we sent out

850
36:50.450 --> 36:51.360
have basically figured out

851
36:51.360 --> 36:53.480
the situation at the Yellow River Crossing.

852
36:53.480 --> 36:54.380
For the river crossing,

853
36:54.380 --> 36:56.110
we have made two preparations.

854
36:56.170 --> 36:57.690
After the operation begins,

855
36:57.690 --> 36:59.060
if the Yellow River is frozen,

856
36:59.060 --> 37:00.460
we will cross on foot.

857
37:01.280 --> 37:02.630
If it isn't frozen,

858
37:02.820 --> 37:06.480
we'll have the engineers make sheepskin rafts to cross the river.

859
37:06.610 --> 37:08.280
Crossing the river is only one aspect.

860
37:08.280 --> 37:09.320
The most important thing is

861
37:09.320 --> 37:11.250
keeping the crossing in our hands.

862
37:11.300 --> 37:12.840
The troops not only need to be able to get out

863
37:12.840 --> 37:13.970
but also to get back.

864
37:14.510 --> 37:15.310
Rest assured.

865
37:15.480 --> 37:18.110
We've made ample preparations for this.

866
37:18.480 --> 37:21.320
However, now many people are worried

867
37:21.480 --> 37:23.280
that after the main forces cross the river,

868
37:23.280 --> 37:25.960
the security of the base area won't be guaranteed.

869
37:25.960 --> 37:26.920
The security of the base area

870
37:26.920 --> 37:29.030
doesn't depend on whether the main forces are there,

871
37:29.030 --> 37:30.230
but on whether the main forces

872
37:30.230 --> 37:32.090
fight well on the exterior lines.

873
37:32.670 --> 37:34.320
Now, to consolidate the base area,

874
37:34.320 --> 37:36.450
haven't we also fought in the north and south?

875
37:36.450 --> 37:39.720
Currently, the Northern Route Army commanded by Comrade Liu Zhidan

876
37:39.720 --> 37:41.760
has already surrounded Hengshan County.

877
37:41.760 --> 37:44.330
The enemy's 86th Division fled at the mere sight of us

878
37:44.330 --> 37:46.850
and won't dare to come back in a short time.

879
37:47.400 --> 37:48.590
As for the southern front,

880
37:48.590 --> 37:52.710
Gao Fuyuan, former Regiment Commander of the 619th Regiment of the Northeastern Army,

881
37:52.710 --> 37:53.550
volunteered

882
37:53.590 --> 37:56.450
to negotiate with the defenders in Ganquan County.

883
37:56.630 --> 37:59.840
They have agreed to a ceasefire with us on the spot.

884
38:00.840 --> 38:02.720
Gao Fuyuan has done a great deed.

885
38:04.760 --> 38:06.490
I was just about to report this.

886
38:06.880 --> 38:08.920
After returning from Ganquan,

887
38:09.150 --> 38:10.580
Gao Fuyuan proposed to go to Luochuan

888
38:10.580 --> 38:13.710
to see his superior, Wang Yizhe, Commander of the 67th Army.

889
38:13.710 --> 38:16.790
And then, through Wang Yizhe, he would meet Zhang Xueliang

890
38:16.790 --> 38:20.350
and persuade him to join forces with us in the war of resistance.

891
38:20.900 --> 38:21.660
Good.

892
38:22.150 --> 38:25.250
Gao Fuyuan used to be Zhang Xueliang's captain of the guard

893
38:25.250 --> 38:26.580
and was deeply trusted.

894
38:26.630 --> 38:28.030
If through him,

895
38:28.060 --> 38:31.470
we can facilitate armistice talks with Zhang Xueliang,

896
38:32.070 --> 38:33.600
it would be a great service.

897
38:34.160 --> 38:35.020
Comrade Enlai.

898
38:35.050 --> 38:36.100
Comrade Enlai.

899
38:36.130 --> 38:36.920
Comrade Luofu.

900
38:36.920 --> 38:37.710
Comrade Jiaxiang.

901
38:37.710 --> 38:38.470
Comrade Bo Gu.

902
38:38.470 --> 38:41.320
We received a New Year's gift.

903
38:41.520 --> 38:42.330
Do you want it?

904
38:42.360 --> 38:43.420
A New Year's gift?

905
38:46.320 --> 38:48.380
Did Comrade Bo Gu get new supplies again?

906
38:48.380 --> 38:49.570
Not really.

907
38:49.760 --> 38:52.490
The New Year's gift isn't necessarily material.

908
38:52.630 --> 38:53.630
Then what is it?

909
38:57.190 --> 38:58.230
It's a telegram.

910
38:58.800 --> 39:00.250
It's a telegram from Comrade Zhu De

911
39:00.250 --> 39:02.940
sent in his own name.

912
39:08.650 --> 39:10.110
Commander-in-Chief Zhu.

913
39:10.270 --> 39:13.150
Since we were separated,

914
39:13.420 --> 39:15.760
this is the first time Commander-in-Chief Zhu has sent us a telegram.

915
39:15.760 --> 39:16.670
Yes.

916
39:17.110 --> 39:20.150
This shows that Comrade Zhang Hao's telegram worked.

917
39:20.260 --> 39:21.460
The Commander-in-Chief's situation

918
39:21.460 --> 39:23.090
has greatly improved.

919
39:23.840 --> 39:25.570
Let's take this New Year's gift

920
39:25.760 --> 39:26.590
to Comrade Zedong

921
39:26.590 --> 39:27.590
and let him share in the joy.

922
39:27.590 --> 39:28.800
Okay. Let's go! Let's go!

923
39:28.800 --> 39:29.670
Let's go. Come on.

924
39:29.670 --> 39:31.070
We've also discussed it.

925
39:31.280 --> 39:32.110
Zhu and Mao

926
39:32.130 --> 39:33.040
are bound by deep affection.

927
39:33.040 --> 39:34.060
The reply telegram

928
39:34.060 --> 39:35.630
must be drafted personally by Comrade Zedong.

929
39:35.630 --> 39:36.280
Sure.

930
39:36.410 --> 39:37.220
Let's go.

931
39:38.900 --> 39:39.760
Comrade Zhu De,

932
39:40.440 --> 39:42.430
having received your telegram today,

933
39:42.430 --> 39:45.630
I should wire you whatever information I have at any time.

934
39:45.840 --> 39:48.800
We have established contact not only with the Northern Bureau

935
39:48.800 --> 39:50.990
and the Shanghai Bureau,

936
39:52.110 --> 39:54.620
but also with the Comintern.

937
39:55.760 --> 39:57.090
This is a great victory.

938
39:58.340 --> 40:00.000
The third "encirclement and suppression" campaign against the Northern Soviet Area,

939
40:00.000 --> 40:02.320
with Zhang Xueliang as the main force,

940
40:02.780 --> 40:04.940
has been completely shattered by us.

941
40:05.670 --> 40:09.020
We are currently expanding the Red Army vigorously.

942
40:09.430 --> 40:10.690
The guerrilla warfare

943
40:10.920 --> 40:16.060
is developing towards the five provinces of Shaanxi, Gansu,

944
40:16.370 --> 40:18.100
Shanxi, Suiyuan, and Ningxia.

945
40:19.320 --> 40:21.880
The Soviet Area has developed greatly.

946
40:22.230 --> 40:25.030
The masses are very enthusiastic in the struggle.

947
40:27.680 --> 40:30.810
In addition to Comrade Lin Yuying sent by the Comintern,

948
40:31.000 --> 40:33.490
Comrade Yan Hongyan has also arrived.

949
40:34.840 --> 40:35.880
It is said

950
40:36.190 --> 40:40.320
that the Communist Party of China has a very high standing in the Comintern

951
40:42.550 --> 40:45.910
and is called the foremost party after the Soviet Union.

952
40:47.080 --> 40:50.680
The Communist Party of China has completed its Bolshevization.

953
40:50.880 --> 40:52.920
All of the Soviet Union, Europe, and the whole world

954
40:52.920 --> 40:54.850
praise our Long March.

955
40:57.230 --> 40:59.560
Under the instructions of the Comintern,

956
40:59.590 --> 41:01.340
the Politburo has made new strategic decisions.

957
41:01.340 --> 41:02.820
Its main slogans are:

958
41:02.940 --> 41:04.870
National United Front,

959
41:05.070 --> 41:07.030
Soviet People's Republic,

960
41:07.190 --> 41:09.920
National Defense Government, and Anti-Japanese United Army,

961
41:09.920 --> 41:12.680
combine the Agrarian Revolution with the National Revolution,

962
41:12.680 --> 41:15.810
and combine the Civil War with the National War.

963
41:18.480 --> 41:20.210
Your development policy

964
41:20.240 --> 41:23.550
must be reported to the Central Committee for approval at any time.

965
41:23.550 --> 41:25.230
As for the past disputes within the Party,

966
41:25.230 --> 41:27.960
they can wait and be resolved by the Cominterm and the 7th National Congress.

967
41:27.960 --> 41:31.560
But organizationally, you must not overstep the proper bounds,

968
41:31.780 --> 41:33.910
which would set you against the Party.

969
41:50.410 --> 41:53.350
[Wayaobu, Shaanxi; Encampment of the 3rd Bureau of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission]

970
41:54.150 --> 41:54.860
Li.

971
42:00.110 --> 42:00.800
Li.

972
42:00.820 --> 42:01.550
Director.

973
42:01.960 --> 42:03.250
Take a rest. I'll do it.

974
42:03.560 --> 42:04.820
You've barely rested.

975
42:04.840 --> 42:05.920
Please sleep a little longer.

976
42:05.540 --> 42:08.930
[Wang Zheng, Director of the Third Bureau of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission]

977
42:06.190 --> 42:07.230
I can't rest easy

978
42:07.230 --> 42:08.550
with the task unfinished.

979
42:08.550 --> 42:09.400
Give it to me.

980
42:09.710 --> 42:11.150
Go. Get some sleep.

981
42:12.480 --> 42:14.320
Can this clumsy method of ours

982
42:14.590 --> 42:16.420
really get us in contact with the 2nd and the 6th Red Army Corps?

983
42:16.420 --> 42:17.380
What's wrong?

984
42:17.490 --> 42:18.690
You lost confidence?

985
42:22.710 --> 42:24.510
There is no agreed wavelength,

986
42:24.530 --> 42:26.010
no call signs,

987
42:26.480 --> 42:27.480
and no codes

988
42:27.510 --> 42:29.000
between us and the 2nd and the 6th Red Army Corps.

989
42:29.000 --> 42:30.930
We can only use this clumsy method.

990
42:31.040 --> 42:32.360
It's been half a month,

991
42:32.770 --> 42:34.890
and there's no useful signal at all.

992
42:49.030 --> 42:50.360
The method isn't wrong.

993
42:50.480 --> 42:51.940
It's the 4th Front Red Army

994
42:52.070 --> 42:53.730
sending a telegram to the 2nd and the 6th Red Army Corps.

995
42:53.730 --> 42:55.320
Then why did it suddenly stop?

996
42:55.320 --> 42:57.580
The 4th Front Army just sent a short code.

997
42:57.660 --> 42:58.910
The battery is dead.

998
42:59.430 --> 43:01.230
They need to pause for ten minutes.

999
43:01.230 --> 43:01.960
Li.

1000
43:02.090 --> 43:04.040
Hurry. Go report to Vice Chairman Zhou.
